# Half Adder

A Verilog implementation of a Half Adder with all four input combinations (00, 01, 10, 11) verified through simulation.

## Inputs / Outputs
- Inputs: a,b
- Outputs: Sum,Carry

## Files
- `half_adder.v` — RTL design
- `half_adder_tb.v` — Testbench
- `half_adder.png` — Waveform

## Simulation
Simulated using Xilinx Vivado. Waveforms verified for all input combinations of 00,01,10,11.
